{
  "name": "turn-steer-terminal",
  "about": "插话落在本轮的收尾阶段。s1：模型这一次本该收尾（纯文本，延迟 1.5 秒），收尾前发现邮箱里有插话（src/agent/loop/AgentLoop.ts:1862-1882），把插话并入、发 turn_continued（reason user_steer）再请求一次；插话在收到 model_request_started 时发出。2026-11-13 两侧各跑 20 次量过：基线 20/20 次会话文件里都是 model_request、model_stream_event(request_started) 落盘之后才是 inbox_mutation；Rust 0/20 与基线一致（14 次 inbox_mutation 在 agent_status_message 之前、6 次在它与 model_request 之间），Rust 自比 20 次里 6 次不同。原因是 Rust 的 model_request 记录要经 sidecar 的模型端口一跳才落盘，而插话由 gateway 直接记下。这是 Rust 的真实差异，场景保持不一致（此前把触发点挪到 model_selection_changed 遮住了它）。s2：maxTurns=1，模型调 bash sleep 2，sleep 期间（tool_call_started 时）插话；工具批之后 2211-2230 的 maxTurns 检查先于下一次请求前取插话（399），轮次以 max_turns 结束，插话一直没被取出，src/agent/turn/TurnRunner.ts:158-173 closeSteerMailbox 把它作为 steer_unapplied（reason turn_ended）发出。",
  "provider": [
    {
      "name": "title",
      "when": [
        "Generate a concise title"
      ],
      "reply": {
        "text": "{\"title\":\"Steer end\"}"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "s1-steered",
      "when": [
        "st-1:",
        "steer-1: also add a closing line"
      ],
      "reply": {
        "text": "Answer with the closing line."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "s1",
      "when": [
        "st-1:"
      ],
      "reply": {
        "text": "First answer.",
        "delayMs": 1500
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "s2",
      "when": [
        "st-2:"
      ],
      "reply": {
        "tool": {
          "id": "call_st2",
          "name": "bash",
          "arguments": {
            "command": "sleep 2; echo slept",
            "description": "sleep"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "ws": "submit_turn",
      "params": {
        "sessionKey": "s-st-1",
        "channelKey": "test",
        "runId": "run-st-1",
        "message": "st-1: answer"
      },
      "answer": [
        {
          "on": {
            "type": "model_request_started"
          },
          "ws": "steer_turn",
          "params": {
            "sessionKey": "s-st-1",
            "runId": "run-st-1",
            "itemId": "item-1",
            "message": "steer-1: also add a closing line"
          },
          "count": 1
        }
      ],
      "timeout": 20000
    },
    {
      "ws": "set_permission_mode",
      "params": {
        "sessionKey": "s-st-2",
        "mode": "bypassPermissions"
      }
    },
    {
      "ws": "submit_turn",
      "params": {
        "sessionKey": "s-st-2",
        "channelKey": "test",
        "runId": "run-st-2",
        "message": "st-2: answer",
        "maxTurns": 1
      },
      "answer": [
        {
          "on": {
            "type": "tool_call_started"
          },
          "ws": "steer_turn",
          "params": {
            "sessionKey": "s-st-2",
            "runId": "run-st-2",
            "itemId": "item-2",
            "message": "steer-2: never applied"
          },
          "count": 1
        }
      ],
      "timeout": 20000
    },
    {
      "sleep": 300
    },
    {
      "ws": "read_session_messages",
      "params": {
        "sessionKey": "s-st-1"
      }
    }
  ]
}
